<title>POLAND: BIG AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 3.3 MLN. [CORRECTED]</title>
<headline>BIG AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 3.3 MLN. [CORRECTED]</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit					  3.26 vs    4.32</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    3.26 vs    5.23</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  2.03 vs   10.08</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	31.54 vs   29.04</p>
<p>OCTOBER 1 TO AUGUST 31			  95-96	94-95</p>
<p>(Company corrects result period from &quot;January to August&quot;)</p>
<p> Net profit					 51.54 vs   50.55</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   51.54 vs   69.42</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		157.20 vs  123.05</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     419.45 vs  292.38</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Inicjatyw</p>
<p>Gospodarczych SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
